6. DATA & PRIVACY
   H·E·N·R·Y stores the following data locally on device:
   • Chat history (SharedPreferences)
   • Memory facts (SharedPreferences)
   • User profile (SharedPreferences)
   • Voice journal entries (local files)
   • Expense logs (SharedPreferences)

   No personal data is transmitted to third parties
   except as required to call AI APIs (Groq, Cloudflare)
   for generating responses. API calls contain only the
   text/image you send.

